# CustomCard — environment variables (Vite frontend only)
# Copy to .env.local to activate optional features.
# None of these are required for the free local app to work.
#
# ── Full backend config ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For Docker / full-stack dev:  infra/env/.env.example  (191 vars, all services)
# For QA / prod:                set vars in Vercel dashboard (environment: Preview / Production)
# Validated at runtime by:      scripts/validate-runtime-env.mjs

# ── AI card generation sidecar ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Start the Python sidecar first:
#   cd card_gen && pip install -e . && ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-... uvicorn card_gen.app:app --port 8001
#
# Then set this to show the "Generate with AI" button in Studio:
# VITE_CARD_GEN_URL=http://localhost:8001
